WEBVTT

00:00:11.498 --> 00:00:12.978
Thank you!

00:00:13.022 --> 00:00:15.285
No. Thank you.

00:00:15.328 --> 00:00:16.460
For what?

00:00:16.503 --> 00:00:19.376
For showing me
how to be happy.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:22.031
Really?
You're finally happy?

00:00:22.683 --> 00:00:23.902
Now?

00:00:23.946 --> 00:00:25.860
I think so.

00:00:25.904 --> 00:00:28.559
Happiness is inside of
all of us, right?

00:00:28.602 --> 00:00:31.692
Sometimes, you just need
someone to help you find it.

00:00:34.173 --> 00:00:37.220
What's gonna happen now,
Princess Poppy?

00:00:37.263 --> 00:00:38.699
I don't know.

00:00:38.743 --> 00:00:41.572
But I know
we're not giving up.

00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:45.358
[RUMBLING][ALL GASP]

00:00:47.621 --> 00:00:48.709
No.

00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:50.537
This is it, Mr. Dinkles.
This is it.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:00.069
Poppy!Bridget?

00:01:00.112 --> 00:01:01.548
BERGEN: [CHANTING]
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

00:01:01.592 --> 00:01:03.376
What are you doing?

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.682
I can't let them eat you.

00:01:04.725 --> 00:01:05.988
But...Come on!

00:01:06.031 --> 00:01:07.424
You gotta go!

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.730
Hurry! Go, go, go!
Get out of here!

00:01:09.774 --> 00:01:11.471
No! Bridget,
if you go in there without us,

00:01:11.515 --> 00:01:13.038
you know what they'll do.

00:01:13.082 --> 00:01:14.126
I know.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:15.475
But, Bridget...

00:01:15.519 --> 00:01:16.520
It's okay.

00:01:18.087 --> 00:01:19.784
It's okay, Poppy.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:25.094
You showed me what it feels
like to be happy.

00:01:25.137 --> 00:01:28.488
I never would have known
if it wasn't for you.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:33.580
And I love you for that.

00:01:33.624 --> 00:01:35.234
I love you too, Bridget.

00:01:36.453 --> 00:01:37.802
CHEF: Bridget!

00:01:37.845 --> 00:01:40.022
[GASPS][BERGEN CLAMORING]

00:01:40.065 --> 00:01:42.198
Go on, now.
You have to hurry!

00:01:42.241 --> 00:01:43.416
Come with us.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:45.157
And make it easier
for them to find you?

00:01:45.201 --> 00:01:47.725
No way!
You have to go. Now!

00:01:47.768 --> 00:01:48.987
Bridget!

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.656
Bye, Poppy.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:15.405
ALL: [CHANTING]
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

00:02:15.448 --> 00:02:17.059
[UPROARIOUS CHEERING]

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:21.802
Wait!

00:02:21.846 --> 00:02:24.762
Chef, shouldn't we wait
for Lady Glittersparkles?

00:02:26.633 --> 00:02:28.070
Oh, you are absolutely right.

00:02:28.113 --> 00:02:31.116
Now, everyone,
there will be
no Trolls until...

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:33.466
the king's plus one
has arrived.

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.381
BERGEN 1: Boo!

00:02:35.425 --> 00:02:37.427
BERGEN 2:
We've waited long enough!

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:38.689
Unless...

00:02:38.732 --> 00:02:40.082
Unless, what?

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:42.997
Well, unless
she doesn't come at all.

00:02:43.041 --> 00:02:44.129
But that's crazy talk.

00:02:44.173 --> 00:02:46.566
Who wouldn't
wanna be with you?

00:02:47.393 --> 00:02:48.786
[ALL MURMURING]

00:02:50.222 --> 00:02:51.223
[SIGHS]

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:54.531
Yeah.

00:02:55.314 --> 00:02:56.663
Maybe we should start.

00:02:56.707 --> 00:02:58.752
ALL: [CHANTING]
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

00:02:58.796 --> 00:03:00.276
ALL: Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

00:03:02.016 --> 00:03:05.150
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!
Yeah! Whoo-hoo!

00:03:05.194 --> 00:03:07.239
POPPY: Go! Come on. Hurry!

00:03:07.283 --> 00:03:08.675
Come on.
Everybody, let's go.

00:03:08.719 --> 00:03:10.895
No Troll left behind!

00:03:10.938 --> 00:03:12.549
Watch your step.

00:03:18.032 --> 00:03:19.338
[BERGEN CHANTING]

00:03:20.252 --> 00:03:21.471
Poppy?

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:25.388
Bridget just ruined
her life to save ours.

00:03:25.431 --> 00:03:26.780
It's not right!

00:03:26.824 --> 00:03:29.305
She deserves to be happy
as much as we do.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:32.743
They all do!

00:03:34.527 --> 00:03:39.358
All right, everybody.
Who's ready to eat Trolls?

00:03:39.402 --> 00:03:41.317
[SIGHS]King Gristle...

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.753
there is only one thing

00:03:42.796 --> 00:03:44.450
that will
ever make you happy...

00:03:44.494 --> 00:03:47.323
and only one Bergen
who can provide it.

00:03:48.237 --> 00:03:50.239
Bon appetit![GASPS]

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:52.719
They're gone!

00:03:52.763 --> 00:03:53.981
ALL: Gone?

00:03:54.025 --> 00:03:55.026
They're gone?

00:03:55.069 --> 00:03:56.114
CHEF: Idget...[GASPS]

00:03:56.158 --> 00:03:57.376
what did you do?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.899
You ate them!

00:03:58.943 --> 00:04:01.511
You greedy, greedy pig.

00:04:01.554 --> 00:04:02.816
No! I...

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.949
BERGEN 1:
She ruined Trollstice!

00:04:04.992 --> 00:04:06.994
Guards, lock her up![ALL CLAMORING]

00:04:09.345 --> 00:04:10.824
BERGEN 2: Let's get her!

00:04:14.176 --> 00:04:15.177
[POPPY GRUNTS]

00:04:32.411 --> 00:04:34.674
[POP MUSIC PLAYING]

00:04:38.939 --> 00:04:40.158
[MUSIC STOPS]

00:04:40.202 --> 00:04:41.333
[ALL GASPING]

00:04:42.073 --> 00:04:43.379
[GASPS]

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.036
Lady Glittersparkles?

00:04:50.647 --> 00:04:51.648
What?

00:04:54.912 --> 00:04:56.870
But how? Why?

00:04:56.914 --> 00:04:58.959
Why did you do this?

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:00.396
Because she didn't think
you would

00:05:00.439 --> 00:05:02.267
want someone like her.

00:05:02.311 --> 00:05:03.877
I mean, hello?

00:05:03.921 --> 00:05:06.271
Is it me you're looking for?

00:05:06.315 --> 00:05:08.273
I don't think so.

00:05:09.361 --> 00:05:11.450
Guards, finish her!

00:05:11.494 --> 00:05:13.496
Oh!No.

00:05:13.539 --> 00:05:15.280
[TROLLS GASPING]Wait!

00:05:15.324 --> 00:05:17.151
King Gristle,
when you were with Bridget,

00:05:17.195 --> 00:05:19.153
you were feeling something,
weren't you?

00:05:19.197 --> 00:05:20.459
Yeah, I was.

00:05:20.503 --> 00:05:22.244
I just thought
it was too much pizza.

00:05:22.287 --> 00:05:23.549
Me, too.

00:05:23.593 --> 00:05:27.031
That feeling?
That was happiness.

00:05:27.074 --> 00:05:28.250
ALL: What?

00:05:28.293 --> 00:05:30.774
But you have to eat
a Troll to be happy.

00:05:30.817 --> 00:05:32.428
Everyone knows that!

00:05:32.471 --> 00:05:34.125
Don't you?

00:05:34.168 --> 00:05:36.780
But King Gristle's
never eaten a Troll
in his life, right?

00:05:36.823 --> 00:05:38.956
No, I haven't.

00:05:38.999 --> 00:05:41.088
Yet, here I am.

00:05:41.915 --> 00:05:43.395
My belly empty...

00:05:44.091 --> 00:05:46.137
and my heart full.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:48.182
[ALL MURMURING]

00:05:49.009 --> 00:05:50.359
CHEF: Don't listen to her!

00:05:50.402 --> 00:05:52.317
There's only
one way to be happy.

00:05:52.361 --> 00:05:53.362
My way![YELPING]

00:05:53.405 --> 00:05:54.450
No!

00:05:54.493 --> 00:05:56.713
With me in charge...

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:59.933
I'll serve you Troll
every day of the year.

00:06:01.108 --> 00:06:03.197
With me as queen...

00:06:03.241 --> 00:06:04.329
all of life will be

00:06:04.373 --> 00:06:06.331
a never-ending feast
of happiness!

00:06:07.245 --> 00:06:08.464
Come on, eat!

00:06:08.507 --> 00:06:09.682
Eat!

